        "exact_quote": "Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. ",
